 "notes": "No setup fee for the plans is stated. Unrelated one-time fee: \"To activate business text messaging, there is a one-time fee of $50\" (line 435), which is for the optional free phone system, not a plan setup fee. \"No contracts\" (line 44). Plus taxes/fees, \"No PATLive fees\" (lines 131-132, 199, 266). Call-answering tiers also say about how many calls they cover (e.g. \"About 20 calls\" for 50 minutes, line 61). \"Most popular\": 200 minutes (line 74), 50 outreaches (line 150), 50 chats (line 217). Each table has a \"Show larger plans\" link (lines 130, 198, 265) whose plans are not in the snapshot. Phone system extras: $0.02 per additional automated minute or text (line 433); $5/mo per additional phone number (line 434). Outbound calls are only placed 8am\u20136pm ET, Mon\u2013Fri (line 406).",
